#. まったく、いつになったら、
#. 次の“犯人当てゲーム”が始まるんだ？
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Jeez, when is the next life-or-death killing game\n"
"going to begin already?"
msgstr ""

#. それとも、この退屈を紛らわすには、
#. 俺自身が動くしかないか？
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Or will I have to get things going myself to alleviate\n"
"this boredom?"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Byakuya"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうしよう？
#. 十神クンを誘ってみようか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I talk to Byakuya for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. まったく、仕方がないな…
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "*Sigh* I suppose it's no use arguing."
msgstr ""

#. 少しだけなら、付き合ってやっていいぞ。
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I will deign to give you a tiny fraction of my time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンと一緒に過ごした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent a tiny fraction of time with Byakuya...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Byakuya a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
